{"title": "Bex's Handmade Cookies", "pageid": 17296, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bex's_Handmade_Cookies", "categories": ["Food", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png/300px-FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/d/df/FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bex's Handmade Cookies image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png/300px-FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/FOOD_Biscuit_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A unique, extremely tasty cookie. Tastes like heroism.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Bex's Cookies\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies#Food\" title=\"Camp Supplies\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/25px-Food_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/38px-Food_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/50px-Food_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Food\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/25px-Food_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Food_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies#Food\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Food</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/38px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/50px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Camp Supplies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Supplies_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Camp_Supplies_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>: 3</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bex\" title=\"Bex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Bex.png/25px-Portrait_Bex.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Bex.png/38px-Portrait_Bex.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Bex.png/50px-Portrait_Bex.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Portrait_Bex.png/25px-Portrait_Bex.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Portrait_Bex.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bex\" title=\"Bex\">Bex</a> after rescuing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Danis\" title=\"Danis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Danis.png/25px-Portrait_Danis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Danis.png/38px-Portrait_Danis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Danis.png/50px-Portrait_Danis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Danis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Danis.png/25px-Portrait_Danis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Danis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Danis\" title=\"Danis\">Danis</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When meeting Bex and Danis, the conversation option, \"It's wonderful to see the two of you back together.\" must be selected to have the option to receive Bex's Cookies.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 202